                       FUNCTION
Function :
      * function is mainly used for code reusability.
      * write once use many times.
      * functions are also called methods.
 Syntax :
        function Function_name(parameters){  -----> function declaration.
         // block of code
         }
function_name(parameter1,parameter2); ---->function call

 Example :
       function operation(v1,v2){
           console.log((v1 + v2)/2);
          }
       operation(10,20); ---->output : 15
       operation(20,2); ----->output : 11
        operation(2);   ----->output : NaN

                                                 
                               |------->default value if the second value not be assigned means it use this default value.
    function operation(v1,v2 = 20){
           console.log((v1 + v2)/2);
          }
         
           operation(10,20); ---->output : 15
           operation(2);   ----->output : 20

suppose,
      function operation(v1 = 12,v2){
           console.log((v1 + v2)/2);
          }
        operation(2);   ----->NaN   because here the value is assigned to v1 not v2.

  




          
